# Read agent docs first

At the start of any work on this project, read **`.cursor/agent-docs/AGENTS.md`** — compact hub with pointers.

Same folder (**`.cursor/agent-docs/`**): **`AGENTS_EDEN.md`**, **`AGENTS_PATTERNS.md`**, **`AGENTS_REFERENCE.md`**, **`SCRIPT_INDEX.md`** (every `.sqf` + verification matrix), **`PRODUCTION_SERVER_ISSUES.md`**. Open only what the task needs. This folder is **gitignored**; **`.cursor/rules/`** remains shareable in git.
